{"id":"wb-8-526","name":"天津市军事管制委员会和中共天津市委旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天津張園","text":"张园，又称天津张园，全称天津市军事管制委员会和中共天津市委旧址，是清代湖北提督兼驻武昌新建陆军第八镇统制张彪的旧居，也是清朝末代皇帝溥仪和孙中山二次护法后北上时期在天津的故居。建于1915年，位于当时的天津日租界的宫岛路（今鞍山道59号），该建筑目前是全国重点文物保护单位和重点保护等级历史风貌建筑、国家AAA级旅游景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5%E5%BC%B5%E5%9C%92","revisionId":94932201,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94932201","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2dbe3c7cacbc388de1614451.jpg","title":"天津张园2022.5_(2).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5%E5%BC%A0%E5%9B%AD2022.5_(2).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5%E5%BC%A0%E5%9B%AD2022.5_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ScareCriterion12","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​天津市和平区 张园","width":320,"height":221}}